Phase 6: Lessons Learned
Goal: Understand what happened, why it happened, and how to prevent recurrence.
6.1 Post-Incident Review Meeting
Schedule within 5 business days of incident closure.
Attendees:
IR Lead (facilitator)
Security Analysts involved in the response
IT/Engineering (if systems were affected)
Business unit owner
CISO or Security Manager
Legal (if regulatory impact)
Agenda:
1. Timeline walkthrough — what happened, when
2. Root cause review — how the attacker got in
3. Response review — what worked, what didn’t
4. Detection review — why did it take X minutes/hours to detect?
5. Action items — concrete improvements with owners and deadlines
