6.4 What Went Well
Document positive findings to reinforce and replicate:
Example: EDR detected malware within 3 minutes of execution
Example: Runbook for ransomware response was followed accurately
Example: Communication cadence with executives was effective
6.5 What Needs Improvement
Document gaps honestly — this is how the team gets better:
Example: No memory forensics capability — analyst had to wait for external help
Example: Alert fired but was not triaged for 4 hours due to overnight shift gap
Example: Backup restoration process took 6 hours — target is 2 hours
