6.7 Playbook Updates
Based on this incident, update the following:
Add new IOC types or attack patterns to detection rules
Update escalation contacts if any were incorrect
Revise any phase that caused delays or confusion
Add new incident type checklist if a new scenario was encountered
Update tool list if new capabilities were used or needed
